vscode: Replace All in Files
vimrc: set nohidden smartcase
open: src/shared/money.ts

@brief
The `Money` type is being renamed `Amount` in the three files that use
it. `formatMoney` keeps its name: it is a function, and the pattern
should say so with a word boundary. Eight times, through the location
list: `:lvim`, `:ldo`, quit.

@keys
| `:lvim /pattern/ **/*.ts` | fill this window's location list |
| `:ldo s/old/new/g \| update` | change every entry, write each file |

@hints
`:lvim /\<Money\>/ **/*.ts`. Seven hits, none of them inside
`formatMoney`.
--
`:ldo s/\<Money\>/Amount/g | update`, then `:q`.

@solution
    :lvim /\<Money\>/ **/*.ts<Enter>  :ldo s/\<Money\>/Amount/g | update<Enter>  :q<Enter>

The same two lines as lesson 8 with an `l` in front of each. The word
boundaries carry the weight: `Money` on its own would also match inside
`formatMoney` on two lines and rename a function you were not asked to
touch.

@start src/shared/money.ts
export type Money = number;

export const formatMoney = (value: Money, currency = 'GBP') =>
  new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB', { style: 'currency', currency }).format(value / 100);

@expected src/shared/money.ts
export type Amount = number;

export const formatMoney = (value: Amount, currency = 'GBP') =>
  new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB', { style: 'currency', currency }).format(value / 100);

@start src/domain/order/order.entity.ts
import { Money } from '../../shared/money';

export type Order = {
  id: string;
  customerId: string;
  status: OrderStatus;
  total: Money;
  placedAt: Date;
};

export type OrderStatus = 'PENDING' | 'SHIPPED' | 'CANCELLED';

@expected src/domain/order/order.entity.ts
import { Amount } from '../../shared/money';

export type Order = {
  id: string;
  customerId: string;
  status: OrderStatus;
  total: Amount;
  placedAt: Date;
};

export type OrderStatus = 'PENDING' | 'SHIPPED' | 'CANCELLED';

@start src/domain/payment/payment.entity.ts
import { Money } from '../../shared/money';

export type Payment = {
  id: string;
  orderId: string;
  amount: Money;
  refundedAmount?: Money;
};

@expected src/domain/payment/payment.entity.ts
import { Amount } from '../../shared/money';

export type Payment = {
  id: string;
  orderId: string;
  amount: Amount;
  refundedAmount?: Amount;
};
